    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita sinooda ng'eanyiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi aba giing'eeta ASEETA ghabwat humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ng'eanyiida manda gil ak ea misana, nea abeeda gwanda misaneeda badayda beega basooda haw sheagi jih; nea gwaneayi Guroorooda ASEETA aba badayda beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Dahinna weeshinda;” ak ghwahidu weeshinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba weeshinda aamiy; ak gooheeli ASEETA weeshinda ea misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguura ASEETA weeshinda Askweari, ak gaguura misaneeda Eawa. Ak ghoah shing'ada ak ghoah sakteayda, eaweeda madeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Gagasa gwanda humng'eeda dageascheeda beega, ak gooheeli beega mida humng'eeda ea beega mida ng'eanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin ASEETA humng'eeda ak gooheeli beega mida hing'eadayda humng'eeda ea beega mida humng'eeda. Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguura ASEETA daadaliil humng'eeda. Ak ghoah shing'ada ak ghoah sakteayda, eaweedeaba iyeenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Beega mida hing'eadayda humng'eeda dabasiina geat hijagi, ak abeeda gwardu ng'eanyiida ghajaam.” Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguura ASEETA heeda ghajaam Ng'eanyiida, nea beegiga saang'a bwat geadiin gaguura Basooda. Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba aamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Dearuuna ng'eanyiida seenga, ea geediga mideawa ghajilga, ea geediga haghweega jiila haghweega was ghajilga nyaawa, nea gaba nih bea healadeadaanyi, aba badayda ng'eanyiida.” Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooruudu ng'eanyiida seenga, geediga jiila ghajilga aba heeluutka nyaawa, ea haghweega mida jeeda ghajilga nyaawa, giliwas aba healadeadaanyi. Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba aamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah shing'ada ak ghoah sakteayda, eaweedeaba samwagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Deabiidana gheaboonyanga dea daliil aba humng'eeda ak gooheeli askweari ea eawa; ak ghoah gichea eeroora damanyoojiga ea askwearjoojiga ea gweanyeeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea deabiidana gheaboonyanga dea daliil aba bugusta humng'eeda ak ghoabwaay ng'eanyiida.” Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin ASEETA gheaboonyan iyeenya hees, gheaboonyaneeda haweewa niirja gaygoombal askweari, nea gheaboonyaneeda mwanang' gaygoombal eawa; ak gwasin eara miinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiin ASEETA dea daliil aba bugusta humng'eeda ak ghoabwaay ng'eanyiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda goombal askweari ea eawa, ak gooheeli weeshinda sea misaneeda. Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba aamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah shing'ada ak ghoah sakteayda, eaweedeaba ang'wan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Deana beega heeluutka haleanjeeda sean mideawa eaweega, ak ghwanung' ghang'eatng'eata dariidaka aba badayda ng'eanyiida nea gwasik daadaliil aba bugusta humng'eeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ASEETA diyeanga hees abiita jeeda basooda ea giliwas diyeayda weelweeli, ea diyeanga sean dukuta beega, aba heeluutka nyaawa, ea giliwas dariideanda mideawa meang'eega aba heeluutka nyaawa. Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba aamiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw ASEETA ghawooda nea gwayeesha, “Ajiila ak ghoasaang'ayiichi ak ghoanyiichi badayda beega basooda, ak ghwasaang'ayiit dariidaka aba badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoah shing'ada ak ghoah sakteayda, eaweedeaba muut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi ASEETA, “Dearuuna ng'eanyiida diyeanga mideawa eaweega aba heeluutka nyaawa: dugwa ea diyeanga badiina jeesinga ea diyeanga jarooda aba heeluutka nyaawa.” Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin ASEETA diyeanga jarooda aba heeluutka nyaawa ea dugwa aba healadeadaanyi, ea diyeanga sean badiina jeesinga aba badayda ng'eanyiida aba heeluutka nyaawa. Ak ghwadaah ASEETA gideaba aamiy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata gwayi ASEETA, “Eaniyean eesina siida jea gawuurjeeweasa, jea eeratiidaneasa; ak abeeda goombal ghweayeega basooda, ea dariidaka humng'eeda, nea goombal dugwa, ak goombal muunda ng'eanyiida sean, ea badahuuka diyeanga sean badiina jeesinga badiina jeesinga aba badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ASEETA siida aba ratoadaanyi, aba ratoadaanyi gwasin ASEETA siida; ng'eedeeda ea gatmooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw ASEETA fiisu ghawooda ak gwayeesha ASEETA fiisu, “Ajiila ak ghoasaang'ayiichi, ak ghoanyiichi ng'eanyiida ak goombali; ak ghoahaaghwi ghweayeega basooda ea dariidaka humng'eeda ea badayba gili wassean mideawa eaweega weelweel aba badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
