        {
          "text": "Ea dea giliwas diyeayda mida ng'eanyiida, ea giliwas dariideanda humng'eeda, ea giliwas diyeayda badiina jeeda aba badayda ng'eanyiida, gilinyoo gwandeawa guroorooda, neagoonyeegwa giliwas geeta nyawiish ghoah hamita.” Ak gwasa. ",
          "type": "text",
